<title>USA: San Francisco $110 mln deal won by First Albany. [corrected 01:20 gmt 16/10]</title>
<headline>San Francisco $110 mln deal won by First Albany. [corrected 01:20 gmt 16/10]</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-10-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>(Corrects winner from Prudential Securities to First Albany Corp.)</p>
<p>First Albany Corp said Tuesday it won $110 million Airports Commission of the City and County of San Francisco, Calif., bonds at a true interest cost of 5.7321 percent. (Corrects true interest cost from 5.76 percent.)</p>
</text>
